# Proteus alignment pipeline — integration pin
#
# This file records the last neurovium/Proteus commit that was manually
# integrated into neuro_ghost/align.py.
#
# To update after pulling in new Proteus changes:
#   1. Inline the relevant changes from neurovium/Proteus into align.py
#   2. Replace the sha below with `git ls-remote https://github.com/neurovium/Proteus HEAD | cut -f1`
#   3. Commit this file alongside the align.py changes
#
# The CI workflow (.github/workflows/track_modules.yml) reads this SHA and
# reports how many commits ahead of it the Proteus main branch currently is.

sha=UNSET
# sha=<paste the Proteus HEAD commit SHA here after your next sync>
